# Two Raging Rivers: Memnite's attack triggers both, and each makes its own piles and label. Bot2 puts Phyrexian Walker and
# Crookshank Kobolds "left" for the first River to resolve, Kobolds of Kher Keep and Crookshank Kobolds "left" for the
# second; Memnite is labelled "left" by both. Only Crookshank Kobolds, "left" in both Rivers' piles, may block it: one River's
# "left" pile is not the other's. Skrelv, Defector Mite's "can't be blocked by black creatures" on Memnite (CR 509.1b) is no
# River's label - the Kobolds are red - and doesn't keep them from blocking.
[Bot1 Deck]
Raging River
Raging River
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Skrelv, Defector Mite
Memnite
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Phyrexian Walker
Kobolds of Kher Keep
Crookshank Kobolds
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Raging River.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Raging River.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Skrelv, Defector Mite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Kobolds of Kher Keep.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Crookshank Kobolds.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Skrelv, Defector Mite.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Modes(1)
Bot1.Colors(Black)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
Bot2.Choose(Phyrexian Walker; Crookshank Kobolds)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot2.Choose(Kobolds of Kher Keep; Crookshank Kobolds)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Block(Phyrexian Walker > Memnite)
! Bot2.Block(Kobolds of Kher Keep > Memnite)
Bot2.Block(Crookshank Kobolds > Memnite)
? Combat.Blocks = Crookshank Kobolds > Memnite

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.BlockRestriction = Can't be blocked by black creatures; Can't be blocked except by creatures with flying and creatures in a "left" pile; Can't be blocked except by creatures with flying and creatures in a "left" pile; Labelled by Raging River; Labelled by Raging River
Bot2.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker.BlockRestriction = In the "left" pile; In the "right" pile
Bot2.Battlefield.Kobolds of Kher Keep.BlockRestriction = In the "left" pile; In the "right" pile
Bot2.Battlefield.Crookshank Kobolds.BlockRestriction = In the "left" pile; In the "left" pile
